     "titulo": "Turns and consensus",
     "texto": [
      "To take the floor you can say **Kan jeg legge til noe?** («Can I add something?»). State the proposal, ask for objections and summarise: **Da er vi enige om…** («So we agree that…»). If there is no consensus, record what remains to be decided and who will check it."
